ICOSale.rescueFunds
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it reverts with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount error
├── when the amount is zero
│   └── it reverts with ZeroAmount error
├── when rescuing ETH
│   ├── when the amount exceeds contract balance
│   │   └── it reverts with InsufficientBalance error
│   └── when the amount is valid
│       ├── it transfers ETH to treasury wallet
│       └── it emits FundsRescued event with correct parameters
└── when rescuing an ERC20 token
    └── when the amount and token are valid
        ├── it transfers tokens to treasury wallet
        └── it emits FundsRescued event with correct parameters